; Synthetic G2D chart. Channel names (TC, BL, HH, SD, BD, ...) are the 2-character GDA names that DTXmaniaNX CDTX.cs maps to DTX channels. Hand-written, public domain (CC0). Derived from the loader code, NOT from a real G2D file.
